    "source_message_id": 212,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "After looking again, I prefer the earlier version. The current top section feels cluttered because the oversized text and large image overlap the \"view dashboard\" button.\n\nPlease restore the previous overall layout and use Harbor Quill as the top heading with the subtitles beneath it.\n\nThe wording can still change, and it does not need to match my draft character for character if that would make the page repetitive, messy, or too sales-focused. Instead of placing selling points inside pill outlines, use underlining to emphasize them. Examples include \"$900 rotating prize every 750 sales\" and \"$10 unlimited, instant commission.\" Supporting commission details should also make the $10 amount, no cap, and immediate timing clear.\n\nPlace the ebook cover beside the headline, using unrestricted dimensions according to what best suits the design. The image I sent still needs to be cropped moderately. Can you handle that, or would you prefer me to do it?\n\nFor the giveaway copy, replace the current wording with both \"claim $900 every 750 sales!\" and the cleaner headline \"$900 prize draw every 750 sales\" where appropriate.\n\nPlease remove the line \"recurring chances at $900\" and also drop the label \"recurring prize wheel:\". The remaining explanation should read: \"3 affiliates chosen from every 750-sale block. Each referral adds another entry!\"\n\nThe supporting pool references should continue to show $900, 750 sales, a 750 sales block, and 3 affiliates where those mechanics are described.\n\nMy kids are making it difficult to focus right now, but I'll return in a little while."
  },
